p0025","role":"受教而笑答者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-81cd5f3b198c21771b67"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-81cd5f3b198c21771b67"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangyan-q-81cd5f3b198c21771b67","order":9477},{"id":"zhangyan-e-1f590173a32cd0d9740f","title":"程秉病，卒官","accounts":[{"id":"zhangyan-a-1f590173a32cd0d9740f","label":"正文","text":"程秉病，卒官","evidence":["zhangyan-q-ac93b426adf432f85789"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhanggu-p0025","role":"卒官者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-ac93b426adf432f85789"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-ac93b426adf432f85789"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangyan-q-ac93b426adf432f85789","order":9478},{"id":"zhangyan-e-51bf2cb0bd405467a85f","title":"程秉著《周易摘》、《尚书驳》、《论语弼》，凡三万余言","accounts":[{"id":"zhangyan-a-51bf2cb0bd405467a85f","label":"正文","text":"程秉著《周易摘》、《尚书驳》、《论语弼》，凡三万余言","evidence":["zhangyan-q-265be8db1590af48b9b0"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhanggu-p0025","role":"著者","evidence":["zhangyan-q-265be8db1590af48b9b0"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-265be8db1590af48b9b0"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangyan-q-265be8db1590af48b9b0","order":9479}],"persons":[{"id":"zhanggu-p0025","name":"程秉","evidence":["zhanggu-q-7b6b8290d820884416dd","zhangyan-q-2f47a64f03bd94137618","zhangyan-q-f4860c5be866bb299911","zhangyan-q-adcc97cbcc63dd7484fc","zhangyan-q-abf60e6e054c2f9dd894","zhangyan-q-a7c645752510d1c6fe2f","zhangyan-q-5fbb451429aa923bbb24","zhangyan-q-81cd5f3b198c21771b67","zhangyan-q-ac93b426adf432f85789","zhangyan-q-265be8db1590af48b9b0","zhangyan-q-d7503dd43194a49833bd","zhangyan-q-37eee38d39df22b3b8b2","zhangyan-q-118dd7b542a20ec2838a"],"facts":[{"id":"zhangyan-f-e29361b2761476e73a26","text":"字德枢，汝南南顿人","evidence":["zhangyan-q-d7503dd43194a49833bd"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhanggu-m-737303ac43ef3e6fa5c7","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及程秉","evidence":["zhanggu-q-7b6b8290d820884416dd"]},{"id":"zhangyan-m-aa347c299580c9ef58a8","kind":"mention","text":"本篇原文记及程秉，具体行动与称谓见引文。","evidence":["zhangyan-q-37eee38d39df22b3b8b2"]},{"id":"zhangyan-m-900718ba66231e4bcf2b","kind":"mention","text":"陈寿评曰：严、程、阚生，一时儒林也","evidence":["zhangyan-q-118dd7b542a20ec2838a"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhanggu-q-7b6b8290d820884416dd","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-7abbb76c1fc797b2239e","layer":"original","quote":"骘于是条于时事业在荆州界者〖11〗，诸葛瑾、陆逊、朱然（程普）〔程秉〕、潘濬、裴玄、夏侯承、卫旌、李肃、﹝一﹞周条、石幹十一人〖12〗，甄别行状〖13〗。因上疏奖劝曰：“臣闻人君不亲小事，百官有司各任其职。故舜命九贤〖14〗，则无所用心〖15〗；弹五弦之琴，咏南风之诗〖16〗：不下堂庙，而天下治也。齐桓用管仲，被发载车〖17〗；齐国既治，又致匡合〖18〗。近汉高祖揽三杰以兴帝业〖19〗，西楚失雄俊以丧成功〖20〗。汲黯在朝〖21〗，淮南寝谋〖22〗；郅都守边〖23〗，匈奴窜迹。故贤人所在，折冲万里〖24〗；信国家之利器，崇替之所由也〖25〗。方今王化未被于汉北〖26〗，河、洛之滨尚有僭逆之丑〖27〗：诚揽英雄拔俊任贤之时也。愿明太子重以经意，则天下幸甚！”","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":386,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":332},{"id":"zhangyan-q-118dd7b542a20ec2838a","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-54c13977d6aeab18cd97","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：张纮文理意正，为世令器〖1〗；孙策待之，亚于张昭；诚有以也〖2〗。严、程、阚生，一时儒林也。至畯辞荣济旧〖3〗，不亦长者乎〖4〗？薛综学识规纳〖5〗，为吴良臣。及莹纂蹈〖6〗，允有先风〖7〗；然于暴酷之朝，屡登显列〖8〗：君子殆诸〖9〗。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":363,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":122},{"id":"zhangyan-q-265be8db1590af48b9b0","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-87ee3c4d1c87bee7f147","layer":"original","quote":"著《周易摘》、《尚书驳》、《论语弼》，凡三万余言","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":5,"end":29},{"id":"zhangyan-q-2f47a64f03bd94137618","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-3cb1d4864b2f127e69a3","layer":"original","quote":"逮事郑玄","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":100,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":16,"end":20},{"id":"zhangyan-q-37eee38d39df22b3b8b2","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-7bb6f9fd953689e4a138","layer":"original","quote":"黄武四年，权为太子登聘周瑜女；秉守太常〖4〗，迎妃于吴。权亲幸秉船〖5〗，深见优礼。既还，秉从容进说登曰〖6〗：“婚姻，人伦之始，王教之基。是以圣王重之，所以率先众庶〖7〗，风化天下。故《诗》美《关雎》〖8〗，以为称首〖9〗。愿太子尊礼教于闺房，存《周南》之所咏〖10〗；则道化隆于上，颂声作于下矣。”登笑曰：“‘将顺其美〖11〗，匡救其恶’，诚所赖于傅君也〖12〗。”","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185},{"id":"zhangyan-q-5fbb451429aa923bbb24","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-7bb6f9fd953689e4a138","layer":"original","quote":"权亲幸秉船〖5〗，深见优礼","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":28,"end":41},{"id":"zhangyan-q-81cd5f3b198c21771b67","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-7bb6f9fd953689e4a138","layer":"original","quote":"既还，秉从容进说登曰〖6〗：“婚姻，人伦之始，王教之基。是以圣王重之，所以率先众庶〖7〗，风化天下。故《诗》美《关雎》〖8〗，以为称首〖9〗。愿太子尊礼教于闺房，存《周南》之所咏〖10〗；则道化隆于上，颂声作于下矣。”登笑曰：“‘将顺其美〖11〗，匡救其恶’，诚所赖于傅君也〖12〗。”","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":42,"end":185},{"id":"zhangyan-q-a7c645752510d1c6fe2f","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-7bb6f9fd953689e4a138","layer":"original","quote":"秉守太常〖4〗，迎妃于吴","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":15,"end":27},{"id":"zhangyan-q-abf60e6e054c2f9dd894","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-14c6a4b6d98725872283","layer":"original","quote":"权闻其名儒，以礼征；秉既到，拜太子太傅","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":101,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19},{"id":"zhangyan-q-ac93b426adf432f85789","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-87ee3c4d1c87bee7f147","layer":"original","quote":"病，卒官","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":103,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":4},{"id":"zhangyan-q-adcc97cbcc63dd7484fc","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-3cb1d4864b2f127e69a3","layer":"original","quote":"士燮命为长史","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":100,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":47,"end":53},{"id":"zhangyan-q-d7503dd43194a49833bd","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-3cb1d4864b2f127e69a3","layer":"original","quote":"程秉字德枢，汝南南顿人也〖1〗。逮事郑玄〖2〗。后避乱交州，与刘熙考论大义〖3〗：遂博通五经。士燮命为长史。","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":100,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54},{"id":"zhangyan-q-f4860c5be866bb299911","section":"chapter-053","block":"b-3cb1d4864b2f127e69a3","layer":"original","quote":"后避乱交州，与刘熙考论大义〖3〗：遂博通五经","section_title":"张严程阚薛传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0113.xhtml","index":100,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":46}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
